{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey of mystical mastery in <i>Mage Blast</i>! This indie pixel-art idle/incremental game puts you in the robes of a powerful mage, progressing through an arcane world of limitless potential. Hone your skills, craft legendary artifacts, and build an unstoppable arsenal of magical spells and modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.poster.avif?t=1768584308\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.webm?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.mp4?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and upgrade your skills to unleash ever-greater magical power. Experiment with different playstyles to discover the most efficient path to ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.poster.avif?t=1768584308\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.webm?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.mp4?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting: The Key to Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful artifacts and magical items to unlock new abilities and deepen your mastery. Craft specialized attack modifiers to further enhance your spellcasting potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Enhance Your Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a diverse arsenal of spells, each with unique attributes. Strengthen and refine them to deal massive damage and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning pixel visuals, an engaging progression system, and endless possibilities, <i>Mage\u00a0 Blast</i>\u00a0is the ultimate magical journey for idle game enthusiasts. Will you rise as the ultimate arcane master?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3650180?t=1768584308","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/cee24937b0c6dd91de7714835b54de1cc14b0fa2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768584308","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/4d1a4960a1fe71bc53f6dc0c2c63dc83791ec07f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768584308","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/4d1a4960a1fe71bc53f6dc0c2c63dc83791ec07f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768584308","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Wishlist &amp; Play the demo first!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/765667cca6fbf01eec407c874436e695.poster.avif?t=1768584308\" width=1170 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/765667cca6fbf01eec407c874436e695.webm?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an epic journey of mystical mastery in <i>Mage Blast</i>! This indie pixel-art idle/incremental game puts you in the robes of a powerful mage, progressing through an arcane world of limitless potential. Hone your skills, craft legendary artifacts, and build an unstoppable arsenal of magical spells and modifiers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.poster.avif?t=1768584308\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.webm?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/393ccec70f41402c5c5aedc66b9fa4db.mp4?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Magic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train and upgrade your skills to unleash ever-greater magical power. Experiment with different playstyles to discover the most efficient path to ascension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.poster.avif?t=1768584308\" width=1170 height=542 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.webm?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/extras/a20e438ee0a44bd238eb9e425025ebdd.mp4?t=1768584308\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Crafting: The Key to Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge powerful artifacts and magical items to unlock new abilities and deepen your mastery. Craft specialized attack modifiers to further enhance your spellcasting potential.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand and Enhance Your Spells</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a diverse arsenal of spells, each with unique attributes. Strengthen and refine them to deal massive damage and dominate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With stunning pixel visuals, an engaging progression system, and endless possibilities, <i>Mage\u00a0 Blast</i>\u00a0is the ultimate magical journey for idle game enthusiasts. Will you rise as the ultimate arcane master?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Frost Owl"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3650180/48dd3cfeaaf9e02e88b389e1327709392873ad00/header.jpg?t=1768584308","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650180/787586233/99633b7ebf71bd4ecb2e9c99b52101eafa860c52/1768570470/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768570874","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650180/787586233/99633b7ebf71bd4ecb2e9c99b52101eafa860c52/1768570470/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768570874","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3650180/787586233/99633b7ebf71bd4ecb2e9c99b52101eafa860c52/1768570470/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768570874","id":257266089,"name":"Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257266089/b37bda0b094fcf2c88837273392ab90d88723ed3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768570874